WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.400
I'm heading out now.

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.180
Go to a hospital if you feel sick, okay?

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.870
Yes... I'll be fine, though.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.970
Hey, come on...

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:14.350
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.110
Well... I'm heading out, then.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.010
Take this.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.740
Come on, I can buy this stuff 
at a convenience store...

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.600
But you have that important event today.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.790
Okay. Thanks.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.360
Well, I'm off!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.850
I can't stay.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:47.720
There's a place I have to be today...

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.700
It might be... time.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:08.680
It's definitely delicious, though!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:46.020
<b>Magical Girl - Meet-and-Greet</b>

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.310
<b>Magical Girl CD Bonus
Meet and Greet Line</b>

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.310
<b>Magical Girls
Look, We're Not Girls</b>

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.090
<i>Magical Girls' long-awaited first single,</i>

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:04.320
<i>"Look, We're Not Girls" became a monster 
hit with 100 million copies sold,</i>

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:04.310
<b>Magical Girls 
Look, We're Not Girls</b>

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.310
This is not the end of the line!

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:10.320
<b>Magical Girl CD Bonus
Meet and Greet Line</b>

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:09.040
<i>We soon ended up holding a CD 
bonus meet-and-greet event.</i>

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:12.730
<i>Wow...</i>

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:19.720
<b>Bag Inspection</b>

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.810
<i>What is this? What?</i>

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:28.720
<b>Tremble Tremble Tremble</b>

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.720
<i>That's... that's a lot of people.</i>

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.690
Looks like it's a big success!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.310
Yeah, a really big success...

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.720
How many people is this, now?

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:39.710
I hear the line continues 
into the next town over!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:40.970
The next town over?

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:42.530
Line forms here!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:44.990
Censored

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.980
You mean, to the happiest place on Earth?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.980
<b>Magical Girl CD Bonus
Meet and Greet Line</b>

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.980
<b>Look, We're Not Girls</b>

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:49.240
I gotta say, even I'm surprised 
it sold this much!

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:56.000
Each CD randomly contains one of 150 photo
 cards with a 3% chance of a meet-and-greet ticket!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.270
(Entry fee required.)

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.090
Do you think my underhanded 
business tactics worked?

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.900
It really was underhanded.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.510
The Consumer Affairs Agency is 
probably giving us the stink eye.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.200
In addition...

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.100
Hey, hey!

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.770
Saki-chan, you love Mohiro, don't you?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.980
How do you feel? How do you feel?

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.780
Hey, is Mohiro-kun looking our way?

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.030
Hey, Manager! Don't you 
have other things to do?

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.300
You meanie!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.790
What's with that expression? 
Are you a teenage girl or something?!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:38.100
Well, I'd better visit the other 
agencies and give my regards!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:43.570
See, before they can get mad about some 
upstart idol company striding onto the scene,

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:45.330
I'm going to spread a little konjac!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.660
Gold konjac... how shameless.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.840
Yeah, yeah. Get going already.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.210
He's finally gone.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.760
How does that man have so much energy?

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.900
Saki, do you remember?

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.810
The boss of the demons
that are after my brother...

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:08.370
He's close by.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:15.040
<b>Bag Inspection</b>

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:20.540
<i>I don't have my stick, but 
I'm sure it'll be fine.</i>

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.420
Heya!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:34.550
Your house... is my house!

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:38.160
Sayo-chin! How's it goin'—

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.440
Still warm.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.060
Don't tell me...

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:00.410
<b>Magical Girls</b>

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.330
<i>The combined meet-and-greet will now begin.</i>

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:06.590
<i>People with tickets up to 
A-199, please line up now.</i>

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:17.740
<i>Could there be demons mixed 
in with today's crowd?</i>

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.730
<b>Sayori</b>
Good luck with your meet-and-greet!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.530
<b>Sayori
</b>Good luck with your meet-and-greet!

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.240
Downloading
Attachment

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.000
<i>Is this a joke?!</i>

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.600
Hey, are you nervous?

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.560
Shut up! Of course not!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.420
There, there, dear.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.180
I see...

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.300
Let's do our best, Mohiro.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.300
Thank you!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.090
I'll never wash these hands again!

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.290
I'm so honored!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.790
I came so far to meet you—

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.820
Love you, love you, love you!

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.860
I bought 10,000 of the first
 prints of your CD!

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.880
Hey! You were banned from this event!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.340
Ore-san! Ore! Ore! Ore! Ore-Ore-Ore...

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.760
So this is a meet-and-greet...

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.820
Idols are amazing...

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.940
What's wrong?

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.010
What is that? Yogurt?

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:16.840
I think it's... condensed milk?

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.090
Ore-san!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.750
Here!

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:21.490
This is for you!

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:23.590
I folded it myself!

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:25.330
Thank you!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.550
But why is it poo?

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.410
Because you step in it so often!

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:32.360
Ah! But this kind of thing 
does feel pretty good...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:37.360
You gotta watch where you 
step more often, okay?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.580
Sure thing. I'll be careful.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.010
Be careful!

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:41.840
Okay!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.750
Bye-bye!

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.870
<i>This connection with the people...</i>

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:52.910
<i>Maybe it means I'm finally being 
acknowledged as an idol, just a little.</i>

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.860
<i>I'll treasure it... even though it's poop.</i>

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.280
Next!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.640
Thank you for coming.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:06.150
<i>That's right... No matter what kind of person
 they are, they're still an important fan—</i>

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:07.990
Hey there, Saki!

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:09.060
Tee-hee-blep.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:12.040
My, you look even hotter 
than you do on screen!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.650
Gracious me!

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.580
It's my friggin' mom!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:20.190
If my being here makes you 
that happy, I'm glad I came!

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:23.790
I thought you were under 
the weather this morning!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.460
Here I come!

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:27.460
No way! You're exuberant!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.570
What is this, parents' day at school?!

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:32.470
That's right, I brought you a pick-me-up.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:43.840
<b>Bag Inspection</b>

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.580
Giving presents to the guests is prohibited.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.050
Please put it in the box at the entrance.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.870
Oh, of course. I'm sorry.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:43.850
Hey, Mohiro-kun is with you!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.770
It's been so long!

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:48.390
Mohiro-kun!

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:50.250
Mohiro!

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:52.910
Stop it! Please, stop it! Stop!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.360
<b>The unexpected interruption regressed 
the magical girl to elementary school age.</b>

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:59.010
That means there's a very good chance
 the boss of the demons is here.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.860
How do you know that?

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.610
Um, it's time for you to—

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:08.050
Your mother's been in the magical 
girl scene for a long time.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.880
Don't underestimate my experience.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.370
Please, your time is up.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.120
You mean... in a "wisdom 
of the elderly" sense?

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:17.030
I'm going to rough you up!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:20.120
But I'll give you one word of warning...

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:28.210
The fact that the leader is here means that 
demons will appear among these people.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.160
It's okay.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.560
I'll work things out like 
I have in the past.

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.440
Of course you will.
 I'll just be going, then.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:48.650
<i>Darn it...</i>

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:49.580
Next!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.430
Okay!

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.430
Ah, thank you for coming!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.600
<i>I'm sorry, Saki... I can't...</i>

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:12.280
Ko-san... you're here?

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.470
Take her to the infirmary!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.260
Thank you very much!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.700
What is all this?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:06.370
Monsters?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.450
Are they fighting?!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.050
Magical Girls, fighting?

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:10.490
They're for real?

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:12.070
Take good care of her.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.540
Heart rate 360.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.410
Blood pressure 400.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.410
A temperature of over 90 degrees Celsius.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:22.100
We have injured people! Come quick!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:23.510
Okay!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.560
The Magical Girls are in trouble!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.630
I need to get this to Saki.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:47.480
The meet-and-greet is canceled!

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.070
Everyone, please evacuate the venue!

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:51.300
What's with this event?

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.520
It's a setup, right?

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:53.570
Must be a practical joke.

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:55.930
I don't wanna be on TV!

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:56.590
I'm putting this online!

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:01.240
<i>The chaos is getting worse!</i>

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.180
Are you okay?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.720
I'm fine.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.390
Come on!

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:13.220
<i>This guy... I thought I took him out before!</i>

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:16.510
Take this!

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:24.300
These guys keep getting stronger...

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.190
I can still barely beat them.

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:28.110
But having to fight them here...

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:40.240
What're you doing, in your condition?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:45.010
Let me go. I need to get this to her!

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:55.760
It's like I just told you.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.530
Your body's a mess.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.820
Yes. I might be at my limit.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:02.640
Yeah. You done a good job.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:04.600
After this battle is over,

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:08.270
I'll need to stop being a magical girl 
and return to my home planet, right?

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.520
Nah, that ain't part of your backstory...

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:13.580
When the first star shines 
in the eastern sky...

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.750
You got that backwards...

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.460
Stop nitpicking everything.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.910
When that first star shines, you'll 
see a light flying into space.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.500
That light will be me!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:25.910
Farewell, Kokoro!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:26.570
Wait!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.660
Don't go, Sayori!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.540
Saki's in trouble back there.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.610
Let me go!

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.000
Sayo-chin... you're a warrior to the end.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:50.790
Mama, are Magical Girls gonna 
lose to those macho men?

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:52.290
They're not, right?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.570
Stop it, Maiko-chan!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.080
Maybe I'll take you to the underworld, too!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.950
I won't make it in time from here!

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:01.860
Stop!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.470
Leave this to me!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.360
Sakuyo!

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:06.810
Everyone, to the exit!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.080
Push him in!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:09.950
Push him in!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.090
Push him in!

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:13.970
Push him in!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.960
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.080
<i>He's touching Mohiro-chan's butt!</i>

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.970
<i>I'll beat him a thousand times over!</i>

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.620
Although this situation is... 
not looking great.

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.300
Come this way!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.890
Mohiro!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.320
Fight, Magical Girls!

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:37.140
Don't let them beat you!

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:37.740
Th-That's right!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.840
Fight!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.120
Fight!

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:39.790
Fight!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.670
Fight, Magical Girls!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.620
Don't let those macho men beat you!

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:49.380
<i>I never knew it could be so reassuring
having people root for you.</i>

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:50.640
Beat them!

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.220
<i>Even if they're hitting me, too...</i>

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:58.360
That's right... even though 
they were all encouraging me,

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.680
I was about to give up.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:02.960
I am...

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:04.690
I am...

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:10.370
A magical girl!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:24.880
What's going on? I can't see!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.840
<i>T-Today's meet-and-greet is canceled due to</i>

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.870
<i>a breakdown of the air conditioning system.</i>

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:34.190
This way to the exit.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:36.090
<i>We will reschedule, so please 
hold on to your tickets.</i>

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.110
Hold me!

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.780
Thanks for cheering me on.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.350
This is the end of today's meet-and-greet.

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:43.250
But please come back again.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.040
Okay!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.560
Wow, the Magical Girls were amazing!

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:52.030
Yeah, there was that bright light, 
and they suddenly got super-strong!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:56.070
I never thought I'd get to see 
them beating up monsters.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.340
You think it was a set-up?

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.970
Seemed a little bloody for that.

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.330
I don't know...

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.270
But it was pretty cool.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.540
Yeah!

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:08.210
Oh? Somebody's blushing.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.550
No, no! I'm not!

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:20.510
That was incredible Love Power, Saki...

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.580
It seems there's nothing 
left for me to do here.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:29.400
I'm pulling you out now!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.690
Thanks once again.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.640
<i>Lucky me!</i>

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:39.040
Look, I do this because I want to.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:40.830
But I...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.580
always end up getting saved by you.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.080
Is there anything I can do for you?

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.550
Oh... really, it's fine.

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:52.330
I do it because I love you.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.590
What?

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:58.580
N-Nothing... that wasn't true.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:00.150
Well, it wasn't <i>not</i> true...

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:01.860
You know, um...

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:16.660
Could you kindly not lay 
your hands on my child?

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.040
<b>Brain Out of Order</b>

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.910
Saki!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.040
<b>Brain Out of Order</b>

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.290
Are you a friend of Ore-san's?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:37.230
No... I'm just a passing magical woman.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.150
Are you my mom?

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.230
No, I'm just a passing—

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:42.290
Mom, that's you, isn't it?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.670
Why are you transformed?

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:50.550
Well, I was watching from 
the shadows, and...

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.570
That's dangerous, though!
You aren't young anymore.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.980
But my daughter was in trouble, you know?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.340
Besides... it's in a parent's nature 
to want to support their child.

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:06.880
Thank you. You saved me.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.120
Good.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:11.130
By the way, have you identified the culprit?

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.200
I still don't have a clue.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:17.120
I thought they might have 
been one of the fans...

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.570
But I don't think any of them
 could be the demons' boss.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:24.860
Maybe it's naive of me, but 
that's what I want to believe.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:27.140
Oh yeah, Mohiro-kun.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.710
Could you tell us who 
you've been with all day?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.520
I think...

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.770
The meet-and-greet staff,

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.280
the PRISMA girls,

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:38.530
the Magical Girls,

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.530
my manager...

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:41.160
And...

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:44.150
Mom!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:49.400
That outfit... looks really good on you.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.670
D-Does it?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:56.420
I'm so glad... that you're my daughter.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.850
Isn't it wonderful?

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.580
Mother and daughter magical girls.

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:07.920
We might be the only such 
pair in the whole world.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.080
Right.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.080
Thank you, Saki.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:15.930
For choosing me to be your mother.

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:18.440
Why are you saying these things now?!

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.550
Because I'm at my limit.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.020
Take this, Saki.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.160
My final present to you.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.400
Don't forget this.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.580
Mom... Mom!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.060
Mom!

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:46.560
You've done well, Sayo-chin.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.080
Mom, thank you!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.530
Sorry, I was in the can!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.700
I feel so much better!

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:10.950
I think the meet-and-greet staff, the PRISMA 
girls, the Magical Girls, my manager, and...

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:09.060
Gosh, it just kept gushing out of me!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.950
Mohiro, I wish you could have seen it!

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:15.460
No...

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:17.960
Hyoe?

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:55.070
What, you weren't ascending to Heaven or 
returning to the Land of Light or something?

00:22:55.070 --> 00:23:00.860
Well, I mostly just wanted to hurry 
to the pharmacy for heating pads...

00:23:00.860 --> 00:23:05.310
The clerk was all, "Where'd you get
 stabbed?!" and crap, dammit!

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:07.700
Well, what else did you expect, 
looking like that?

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:10.370
What do you want in your miso soup tonight?

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:14.950
<b>Censored</b>

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:11.670
Eggplant and ginger!

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:13.230
I love that crap, dammit!

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:14.950
Are you eating dinner with us?!

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.960
<b>Censored</b>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:21.950
<i>Michiru here!</i>

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:22.870
<i>Ruka here!</i>

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:24.840
<i>Together, we're PRISMA!</i>

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:27.070
<i>At last, it's our turn on stage!</i>

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.890
<i>No one was looking forward to it.</i>

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.840
<i>Next time, "Magical Girl - Another and Another."</i>

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Magical Girl - Another and Another</b>

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:34.170
<i>You'd better watch, okay?</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Illustration: Monokubo
